ystem, and ideology of the empire have not been addressed archaeologically, although their general patterns are known from historical studies (e.g, Johnson, 1921; Law, 1977)." Regarding this period, however, one of the historical studies mentioned in this quote also notes:  "Of the earliestperiod of Oyo history, before the sixteenth century, very little is known." Law does not then go on to provide specific information directly relevant to this variable.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 900, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 760})
